# URL Editor

A simple browser extension to parse and edit the current page's URL.

Built with Solid 2, Tailwind CSS 4, and Vite on Rolldown, with Bun for everything else. Install [Bun](https://bun.com), then:

```sh
bun install
bun run dev      # preview the popup at http://127.0.0.1:5173
bun run build    # build dist/url-editor-chrome and dist/url-editor-firefox
bun run check    # format check, lint, and typecheck
```

See [AGENTS.md](./AGENTS.md) for the layout and every task.
